## 📊 SCHEDULE OPTIONS

| Schedule | Cron Expression | When It Runs | Best For |
|----------|-----------------|--------------|----------|
| **Daily at 2 AM** | `0 2 * * *` | Every day at 2:00 AM | Balanced automation (default) |
| **Weekdays only** | `0 2 * * 1-5` | Mon-Fri at 2 AM | Business hours optimization |
| **Every 6 hours** | `0 */6 * * *` | Every 6 hours | Real-time monitoring (less recommended for free scraping) |
| **At 3 AM** | `0 3 * * *` | Every day at 3:00 AM | Classic off-hours timing |
| **Weekends only** | `0 2 * * 6,0` | Sat/Sun at 2 AM | Lighter schedule for weekends |

